   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Tactician Labs \u00b7 browser (React) \u2192 TanStack server fn \u2192 Python agent service (Gemini tool loop) \u2192 BigQuery / calculators \u2192 back through the same hops \u2192 hand-drawn SVG charts.   Shapes are the real field names (snake_case in Python and on the wire, camelCase in TS).",
