   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "createServerFn({ method: 'POST'\n}).inputValidator(zod)\n\u2022 zod re-checks the same limits as the agent:\n  question 1-500, history <= 12 \u00d7 text <= 8000,\n  conversation_id uuid (optional)\n\u2022 handler: const { askAgent } = await\n  import('@/server/agent.server')\n  \u2192 askAgent(data.question, data.history, \n    data.conversation_id)\n\nRuns on the web server only. The browser never\nreaches BigQuery, Gemini or the agent.",
   "originalText": "createServerFn({ method: 'POST'\n}).inputValidator(zod)\n\u2022 zod re-checks the same limits as the agent:\n  question 1-500, history <= 12 \u00d7 text <= 8000,\n  conversation_id uuid (optional)\n\u2022 handler: const { askAgent } = await\n  import('@/server/agent.server')\n  \u2192 askAgent(data.question, data.history, \n    data.conversation_id)\n\nRuns on the web server only. The browser never\nreaches BigQuery, Gemini or the agent.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
