   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "response = genai_client.models.generate_content(model=answer.model, contents=contents, config=config)\n\nresponse.usage_metadata \u2192 ModelCall{ prompt_tokens, output_tokens, thinking_tokens, cached_tokens,\ntotal_tokens, latency_ms }  \u2192 answer.model_calls\nresponse.function_calls \u2192 list of FunctionCall (0 or more per turn)\n  FunctionCall = { name: 'sql' | 'roll_odds' | 'gold_projection',  args: { ...keyword args picked by the\n   model... } }\n\nGemini chooses the tool and fills args from the user's wording, the system prompt (INSTRUCTIONS) and\nthe earlier tool results.\n\nno function_calls and response.text  \u2192  answer.text = response.text, return  (go to 7)\nfunction_calls present               \u2192  6b",
   "originalText": "response = genai_client.models.generate_content(model=answer.model, contents=contents, config=config)\n\nresponse.usage_metadata \u2192 ModelCall{ prompt_tokens, output_tokens, thinking_tokens, cached_tokens,\ntotal_tokens, latency_ms }  \u2192 answer.model_calls\nresponse.function_calls \u2192 list of FunctionCall (0 or more per turn)\n  FunctionCall = { name: 'sql' | 'roll_odds' | 'gold_projection',  args: { ...keyword args picked by the\n   model... } }\n\nGemini chooses the tool and fills args from the user's wording, the system prompt (INSTRUCTIONS) and\nthe earlier tool results.\n\nno function_calls and response.text  \u2192  answer.text = response.text, return  (go to 7)\nfunction_calls present               \u2192  6b",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
