   "text": "6b call_tool(call)  (nested in _ask)",
   "originalText": "6b call_tool(call)  (nested in _ask)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "t-54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1036,
   "y": 732.8,
   "width": 888,
   "height": 218.4,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g-51"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1708957521,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1679116189,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "tools = { 'sql': sql, 'roll_odds': roll_odds, 'gold_projection': gold_projection }\n\n1. fn = tools.get(call.name)\n     unknown \u2192 [{ error: 'Unknown tool X. Use one of [...]' }]\n2. inspect.signature(fn).bind(**args)\n     wrong args \u2192 [{ error: 'Bad arguments for X: ...' }]\n3. return fn(**args)\n     sql \u2192 list[dict] (rows)       roll_odds, gold_projection \u2192 dict\n\nErrors are returned as the tool result, never raised, so Gemini reads the message and calls again with\nfixed arguments.\nTools run one after another inside the turn; several calls in one turn are all answered before the\nnext generate_content.",
   "originalText": "tools = { 'sql': sql, 'roll_odds': roll_odds, 'gold_projection': gold_projection }\n\n1. fn = tools.get(call.name)\n     unknown \u2192 [{ error: 'Unknown tool X. Use one of [...]' }]\n2. inspect.signature(fn).bind(**args)\n     wrong args \u2192 [{ error: 'Bad arguments for X: ...' }]\n3. return fn(**args)\n     sql \u2192 list[dict] (rows)       roll_odds, gold_projection \u2192 dict\n\nErrors are returned as the tool result, never raised, so Gemini reads the message and calls again with\nfixed arguments.\nTools run one after another inside the turn; several calls in one turn are all answered before the\nnext generate_content.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
  },
