   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Odds of buying every copy a board still needs, at several amounts of gold.\n\nargs from Gemini:\n{ level: 8,                                      // 2..11\n  units: [{ name: 'Lillia', copies: 3, copies_out: 2 }],   // copies still to buy; copies_out = \n  already gone from the pool\n  tier_out: [{ cost: 3, copies: 6 }],            // other copies of that cost that are gone (optional)\n  gold: [50, 80, 100] }                          // optional; default 50, 60 ... 100\n\n\u2192 run_roll_odds(client, level, units, tier_out, gold, answer) \u2192 _roll_odds(...)",
   "originalText": "Odds of buying every copy a board still needs, at several amounts of gold.\n\nargs from Gemini:\n{ level: 8,                                      // 2..11\n  units: [{ name: 'Lillia', copies: 3, copies_out: 2 }],   // copies still to buy; copies_out = \n  already gone from the pool\n  tier_out: [{ cost: 3, copies: 6 }],            // other copies of that cost that are gone (optional)\n  gold: [50, 80, 100] }                          // optional; default 50, 60 ... 100\n\n\u2192 run_roll_odds(client, level, units, tier_out, gold, answer) \u2192 _roll_odds(...)",
