   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "_gold_projection\n \u2022 AugmentChoice validate; look each up (normalised) in augments.json masterlist; unknown \u2192 \n   ValueError('Unknown augment(s) ...')\n \u2022 Start(round, level, xp, gold, streak): args, else Rules defaults (start 2-1)\n \u2022 ScenarioChoice \u2192 ScenarioPlan: move lists \u2192 dicts keyed by Round = (stage, n); same round twice \u2192 \n   ValueError\ncalculate_gold_projection(end_round, picks, start, scenarios=plans or None)\n \u2022 no scenarios \u2192 presets win / mixed / loss, nothing spent (so gold is a ceiling)\n \u2022 resolve_end(): end_round, else w/l string length, else '4-2'  \u2192  validate()  \u2192  \n   rounds_between(start, end)\n \u2022 per scenario: validate_plan() \u2192 run_plan():\n     'win' | 'loss' | 'wlwl...'  \u2192 simulate(rounds, wins, start, augments, rules, plan)\n     'mixed' \u2192 mixed(): 400 seeded runs (MIXED_SEED 18), 2-3 wins per stage, series averaged; must be \n     affordable in every run\n \u2022 simulate(), per round: income = interest (capped) + passive + last fight's reward (win gold + \n   streak) + carousel + augment gold\n   \u2192 then plan.gold entry \u2192 then plan.levels (buys XP: 4 gold = 4 XP, whole purchases).  Overspend \u2192 \n     ValueError with balances\n \u2022 summarise(): end totals, levels 8 and 9 { xp_missing, gold_cost, leftover };  level_curve()\n \u2022 Rules defaults other than the XP table are placeholders until real values are supplied",
   "originalText": "_gold_projection\n \u2022 AugmentChoice validate; look each up (normalised) in augments.json masterlist; unknown \u2192 \n   ValueError('Unknown augment(s) ...')\n \u2022 Start(round, level, xp, gold, streak): args, else Rules defaults (start 2-1)\n \u2022 ScenarioChoice \u2192 ScenarioPlan: move lists \u2192 dicts keyed by Round = (stage, n); same round twice \u2192 \n   ValueError\ncalculate_gold_projection(end_round, picks, start, scenarios=plans or None)\n \u2022 no scenarios \u2192 presets win / mixed / loss, nothing spent (so gold is a ceiling)\n \u2022 resolve_end(): end_round, else w/l string length, else '4-2'  \u2192  validate()  \u2192  \n   rounds_between(start, end)\n \u2022 per scenario: validate_plan() \u2192 run_plan():\n     'win' | 'loss' | 'wlwl...'  \u2192 simulate(rounds, wins, start, augments, rules, plan)\n     'mixed' \u2192 mixed(): 400 seeded runs (MIXED_SEED 18), 2-3 wins per stage, series averaged; must be \n     affordable in every run\n \u2022 simulate(), per round: income = interest (capped) + passive + last fight's reward (win gold + \n   streak) + carousel + augment gold\n   \u2192 then plan.gold entry \u2192 then plan.levels (buys XP: 4 gold = 4 XP, whole purchases).  Overspend \u2192 \n     ValueError with balances\n \u2022 summarise(): end totals, levels 8 and 9 { xp_missing, gold_cost, leftover };  level_curve()\n \u2022 Rules defaults other than the XP table are placeholders until real values are supplied",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "autoResize": true
