   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "list[dict], <= 200 rows, e.g.\n[ { name: 'Taric', average_placement: 4.21, top4_rate: 0.61, games: 5230 }, ... ]\nor  [ { error: '...' } ]  (model fixes the SQL and retries)\n\nSide effects on Answer:\n  answer.queries    += query\n  answer.rows        = rows            (last successful result)\n  answer.sql_runs   += SqlRun{ query, rows, bytes_billed, latency_ms, error }\n\nGemini receives: the rows (they are the evidence for the answer text).\nThe page receives: only the SQL strings \u2192 collapsed 'SQL (n)' block.\nSQL rows are NOT charted; the agent's prose is the output.",
   "originalText": "list[dict], <= 200 rows, e.g.\n[ { name: 'Taric', average_placement: 4.21, top4_rate: 0.61, games: 5230 }, ... ]\nor  [ { error: '...' } ]  (model fixes the SQL and retries)\n\nSide effects on Answer:\n  answer.queries    += query\n  answer.rows        = rows            (last successful result)\n  answer.sql_runs   += SqlRun{ query, rows, bytes_billed, latency_ms, error }\n\nGemini receives: the rows (they are the evidence for the answer text).\nThe page receives: only the SQL strings \u2192 collapsed 'SQL (n)' block.\nSQL rows are NOT charted; the agent's prose is the output.",
