   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "AgentBody (snake_case) \u2192 camelCase DTOs:\n\u2022 toRollOdds(run): all_units\u2192allUnits,\n  per_unit\u2192perUnit, copies_out\u2192copiesOut,\n  tier_out\u2192tierOut, results + curve via toRollOddsRow\n\u2022 toGoldProjection(run): free_roll_gold\u2192freeRollGold,\n  total_gold\u2192totalGold, natural_xp\u2192naturalXp,\n  level_curve\u2192levelCurve, series via\n  toGoldProjectionPoint, levels['8'] { xpMissing,\n  goldCost, leftover }\n\nAgentAnswer {\n  text: string,\n  queries: string[],\n  rollOdds: RollOddsRun[],\n  goldProjections: GoldProjectionRun[]\n}\n\u2192 returned by askAgentFn (serialised) to the browser",
   "originalText": "AgentBody (snake_case) \u2192 camelCase DTOs:\n\u2022 toRollOdds(run): all_units\u2192allUnits,\n  per_unit\u2192perUnit, copies_out\u2192copiesOut,\n  tier_out\u2192tierOut, results + curve via toRollOddsRow\n\u2022 toGoldProjection(run): free_roll_gold\u2192freeRollGold,\n  total_gold\u2192totalGold, natural_xp\u2192naturalXp,\n  level_curve\u2192levelCurve, series via\n  toGoldProjectionPoint, levels['8'] { xpMissing,\n  goldCost, leftover }\n\nAgentAnswer {\n  text: string,\n  queries: string[],\n  rollOdds: RollOddsRun[],\n  goldProjections: GoldProjectionRun[]\n}\n\u2192 returned by askAgentFn (serialised) to the browser",
