   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "setThread(t => t.map(e => e.id === id ? { ...e,\nanswer } : e))\nExchange { id, question, answer?: AgentAnswer,\nerror?: string }\n\nRender order for each answer:\n1. <AgentMarkdown text reference comps variants />\n2. distinctRollOdds(answer.rollOdds).map(run \u2192\n<RollOddsChart run />)\n3. distinctGoldProjections(answer.goldProjections).ma\np(run \u2192 <GoldProjectionCharts run />)\n4. <details> 'Roll odds (n)' \u2192 RollOddsCard tables\n5. <details> 'SQL (n)' \u2192 each query in a <pre>\n\nhistory for the next question = this exchange's\nquestion + answer.text (text only).",
   "originalText": "setThread(t => t.map(e => e.id === id ? { ...e,\nanswer } : e))\nExchange { id, question, answer?: AgentAnswer,\nerror?: string }\n\nRender order for each answer:\n1. <AgentMarkdown text reference comps variants />\n2. distinctRollOdds(answer.rollOdds).map(run \u2192\n<RollOddsChart run />)\n3. distinctGoldProjections(answer.goldProjections).ma\np(run \u2192 <GoldProjectionCharts run />)\n4. <details> 'Roll odds (n)' \u2192 RollOddsCard tables\n5. <details> 'SQL (n)' \u2192 each query in a <pre>\n\nhistory for the next question = this exchange's\nquestion + answer.text (text only).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
