   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "react-markdown + remark-gfm, no raw HTML\n\u2022 a paragraph that is only a link\n  /compositions/<comp_id>[?variant=<variant_id>] \u2192\n  CompCard / VariantCard (remark-comp-cards); ids not\n  in the loader's cached comps/variants render as\n  plain text\n\u2022 unit, item and trait names (and api names) \u2192\n  GameIcon (entity-matcher, remark-entities)\n\nThe prose is the only place SQL results show up; the\ntwo chart components below are fed by the structured\ntool outputs.",
   "originalText": "react-markdown + remark-gfm, no raw HTML\n\u2022 a paragraph that is only a link\n  /compositions/<comp_id>[?variant=<variant_id>] \u2192\n  CompCard / VariantCard (remark-comp-cards); ids not\n  in the loader's cached comps/variants render as\n  plain text\n\u2022 unit, item and trait names (and api names) \u2192\n  GameIcon (entity-matcher, remark-entities)\n\nThe prose is the only place SQL results show up; the\ntwo chart components below are fed by the structured\ntool outputs.",
