   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "input: RollOddsRun { level, units: [{ name, cost, copies, copiesOut }], tierOut: [{ cost, copies }],\n                     results: RollOddsRow[], curve: RollOddsRow[] }      RollOddsRow = { gold, rolls, allUnits,\n                      perUnit: { [name]: number } }\n\ndistinctRollOdds(runs): key = JSON.stringify([level, units, tierOut]); calls with the same key merge into one\nrun\n  \u2192 results unioned by gold and sorted, the longer curve kept.\n\nSVG line + filled area, 240 px high\n  x = gold         0 ... xMax, ticks from xTicks(reach, plotWidth),  reach = max(last curve gold, every asked \n  gold)\n  y = allUnits     0 ... 1, ticks 0 / 25 / 50 / 75 / 100 %\n  line points      [[x(0), baseline], ...curve.map(p => [x(p.gold), y(p.allUnits)])]    flat on 0 % until the \n  copies are paid for (copiesCost = curve[0].gold)\n  dots             one per results row (the gold amounts that were asked) once allUnits >= 1 %\n  hover, touch, arrow keys \u2192 active = round((gold - spend) / 2) = index into curve \u2192 tooltip lists \n  perUnit[unit.name] for every unit\n  aria-label       describeRollOdds(run) + 'Chance of hitting every unit: 73 % at 80 gold, ...'",
   "originalText": "input: RollOddsRun { level, units: [{ name, cost, copies, copiesOut }], tierOut: [{ cost, copies }],\n                     results: RollOddsRow[], curve: RollOddsRow[] }      RollOddsRow = { gold, rolls, allUnits,\n                      perUnit: { [name]: number } }\n\ndistinctRollOdds(runs): key = JSON.stringify([level, units, tierOut]); calls with the same key merge into one\nrun\n  \u2192 results unioned by gold and sorted, the longer curve kept.\n\nSVG line + filled area, 240 px high\n  x = gold         0 ... xMax, ticks from xTicks(reach, plotWidth),  reach = max(last curve gold, every asked \n  gold)\n  y = allUnits     0 ... 1, ticks 0 / 25 / 50 / 75 / 100 %\n  line points      [[x(0), baseline], ...curve.map(p => [x(p.gold), y(p.allUnits)])]    flat on 0 % until the \n  copies are paid for (copiesCost = curve[0].gold)\n  dots             one per results row (the gold amounts that were asked) once allUnits >= 1 %\n  hover, touch, arrow keys \u2192 active = round((gold - spend) / 2) = index into curve \u2192 tooltip lists \n  perUnit[unit.name] for every unit\n  aria-label       describeRollOdds(run) + 'Chance of hitting every unit: 73 % at 80 gold, ...'",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
