   "text": "\u2022 SQL rows: only reach Gemini, which turns them into the markdown text; the page shows\n  the SQL strings.\n\u2022 RollOddsCard: collapsed tables of the roll odds results per run.\n\u2022 Errors from tools never reach the page; Gemini repairs and retries (budget: 8 model\n  calls).",
   "originalText": "\u2022 SQL rows: only reach Gemini, which turns them into the markdown text; the page shows\n  the SQL strings.\n\u2022 RollOddsCard: collapsed tables of the roll odds results per run.\n\u2022 Errors from tools never reach the page; Gemini repairs and retries (budget: 8 model\n  calls).",
